t protocol was complete for both nodes: each had a healthy pre-restart state, acknowledged restart, changed boot identity, recovered system/service/data state, and successful post-restart synchronization. Fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate both restarts.","limitations":["The fixed lifecycle snapshots do not inventory the task-specific files, systemd unit definitions, SSH authorization, or host keys; their final state is established primarily by captured executor commands rather than an independent task-specific probe.","The retained comment-only verification markers are benign but prevent a completely residue-free hygiene assessment."]}
